  "interfaceBaseline": "V31 iPhone build 141 source; clearer grouped animation gallery with visible motion-pattern previews; dedicated Brand animaties with six selectable accent tones and 21 curated existing SPI exhibition recipes; perspective tunnel previews; shared colour wheel for editable Brand colours; all original wire recipes preserved; bulk-select and atomically assign compatible ledlines to a zone; rounded shared modal headings; colour-first whole-stand sheet with one button to the full scenes gallery; unified LEDline scope dropdown; return navigation and RGBW/SPI badge integrated into the light-control heading; duplicate zone title removed; simplified zone and receiver-add flow; consistent ledline language; shared rounded zone picker in receiver search with one matching location-minus icon for receivers without a zone; SPI endpoint guidance; user-selectable compact, medium and large LED previews; direct entry to the active animation settings with the gallery one tap away; background colour is grouped with animation colours behind an explicit toggle; animation smoothness is fixed at 100%, including when older active animations are opened; adjustable settings have a meaning icon and plain-language hint, with the active live preview identified as the immediate visual feedback",
